<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal accepts no bids at drain offer.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal accepts no bids at drain offer.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said that it accepted no bids at its offer to drain four- and nine-week money market funds on Monday.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
